LanguageData.ARIO_TrialEnded:
The trial with {0} has ended.

{1}

Treat bleeding immediately. Existing injuries, corpses and belongings remain; no automatic healing or recruitment occurs. A mobile foreign champion walks out in their original faction. A downed guest remains for medical rescue and keeps the map available. Select the site → Evacuate trial ground to reform your caravan after the fight. Include your wounded, corpses and desired loot; uncollected objects on an otherwise abandoned map follow normal map removal. You can return by caravan while an injured guest keeps the map open.

LanguageData.ARIO_TrialAutoEnded:
The trial with {0} is resolved.

{1}

Your caravan can continue normally. Care for wounds and bleeding. Survivors keep their original allegiance; fallen bodies retain their gear. If a casualty cannot be brought home immediately, their return remains pending until your caravan or keep can receive them.
